### 2. User Knowledge
- **Design Constraints:** Formal/minimalist style (ivory background, slate/navy accents). No external API calls; local JSON-only data structure.
- **Dynamic Content:** User explicitly requested `height: auto` for all canon text containers to prevent truncation.
- **Data Structure:** User provided canons 90–170+ following the schema `{"numero": int, "libro": string, "titulo": string, "texto": string, "temas": array}`. (Note: User uses `"titulo"` in the new data, whereas previous Libro I data used `"capitulo"`; this will need to be unified during the merge).

### 3. Work Accomplished
- **Initial Migration:** Successfully merged 89 canons (1–89) of Libro I with 89 canons of Libro VI (total 178 canons).
